			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild configuration and tsconfig with consistent whitespace\n\nThe ESBuild configuration in Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js and the TypeScript configuration in tsconfig.json have been reformatted with consistent spacing. Extra blank lines between property declarations, export statements, and configuration blocks have been removed. Array values in tsconfig.json (lib, exclude, include) are expanded to multi-line format for readability.\n\nThe generated artifacts in Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js and Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js are updated to match the source reformatting. This establishes a consistent formatting pattern across the Worker element's build configuration.",
